  "description": "Seven years ago, standard words of confession were replaced with an awkward, child-like declaration: \"I want to have you at least once.\" Nayeon had believed she would never see Juhyeok again after that moment. However, when fate brings them back together, Juhyeok remembers every single detail of her past declaration. Confronting her with the same quiet, suffocating intensity as before, he leaves her with a dangerous invitation: \"Then try and have me.\"",
